    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;I am my own abyss and my own salvation.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;AbyssEschatonSurvivors&quot;</strong> is a bullet-hell roguelike game where you venture into shifting dreamscapes to challenge the minions of the Abyssal Lord, culminating in a climactic battle against the malevolent ruler at the depths of the Abyssal Maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two modes available: Survivor Mode and Infinite Challenge Mode.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivor Mode\uff1a</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688150/extras/6b8d65dd37389b29a8bcbd11836060d0.poster.avif?t=1754618245\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688150/extras/6b8d65dd37389b29a8bcbd11836060d0.webm?t=1754618245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688150/extras/6b8d65dd37389b29a8bcbd11836060d0.mp4?t=1754618245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Infinite Challenge\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688150/extras/d328607bfd661c38d1fcff88df402203.avif?t=1754618245\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 playable characters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within the Dream Sanctuary, you will encounter unexpected travelers trapped in cycles of fate. Hone diverse skills to empower your hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688150/extras/64762ad27ed02be03e993da109d4421b.avif?t=1754618245\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688150/extras/b3816f4d497380d4d1c538df4f02b768.avif?t=1754618245\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of equipment and ancient relics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >collect formidable equipment to repel increasingly powerful foes, and ultimately descend into the abyss of endless reincarnation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688150/extras/ffa755ce597dd4a9fa3e8bb0d89c1c0c.avif?t=1754618245\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;I am my own abyss and my own salvation.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;AbyssEschatonSurvivors&quot;</strong> is a bullet-hell roguelike game where you venture into shifting dreamscapes to challenge the minions of the Abyssal Lord, culminating in a climactic battle against the malevolent ruler at the depths of the Abyssal Maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two modes available: Survivor Mode and Infinite Challenge Mode.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivor Mode\uff1a</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688150/extras/6b8d65dd37389b29a8bcbd11836060d0.poster.avif?t=1754618245\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688150/extras/6b8d65dd37389b29a8bcbd11836060d0.webm?t=1754618245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688150/extras/6b8d65dd37389b29a8bcbd11836060d0.mp4?t=1754618245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Infinite Challenge\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688150/extras/d328607bfd661c38d1fcff88df402203.avif?t=1754618245\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 playable characters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within the Dream Sanctuary, you will encounter unexpected travelers trapped in cycles of fate. Hone diverse skills to empower your hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688150/extras/64762ad27ed02be03e993da109d4421b.avif?t=1754618245\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688150/extras/b3816f4d497380d4d1c538df4f02b768.avif?t=1754618245\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of equipment and ancient relics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >collect formidable equipment to repel increasingly powerful foes, and ultimately descend into the abyss of endless reincarnation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688150/extras/ffa755ce597dd4a9fa3e8bb0d89c1c0c.avif?t=1754618245\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Conquer layered dreams, battle the Abyssal Lord's minions, gather Dream Essence! In this roguelike action game, forge heroes in the Dream Sanctuary by collecting gear, upgrading skills, confronting the Abyssal Lord. &quot;Even fate won't deter you, My Lord? Break the cursed cycle. I'll light your path.\u201d",
